{"step_index":514,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T01:23:08Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-15T10:23:08+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-15T10:23:11+09:00\nThe search for \"\"우수경\" 만화 OR 웹툰\" returned the following summary:\n우수경 작가는 웹툰 **《디어 마이 유니버스》**를 집필한 작가입니다[1][2].\n\n*   **작품 정보**: 《디어 마이 유니버스》는 외계인 '파이'와 지구인 '우주'의 이야기를 다룬 BL(Boys Love) 장르의 판타지/순정 웹툰으로, 총 60화로 완결되었습니다[1][3][4].\n*   **주요 플랫폼**: 리디, 네이버 시리즈, 미스터블루 등에서 감상할 수 있습니다[5][2][3].\n\n참고로 동명이인의 교육학 분야 저자(예: 《영유아음악교육》 저자)도 있으나, 만화/웹툰 분야에서는 《디어 마이 유니버스》의 우수경 작가를 의미합니다[6][7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [nate.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF1itmWlndT2ZUmnN3WChVXkEliH0dNUhkbKkCajxcSwkwU-kPXL1d0OJ6LX9bQD8M0efZYxrbUlvdFV78LORMHOEH9Pmv16YpWhYzYiqS8S02UutKKUCkVjUprjxKDNXhqYw==)\n[2] [naver.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE2ofLNxIWk0N-qYg29YYf3N_9DLyOY2EtN_o1JD9mPmMojFWbqHa2AP4QpCDp9qYML-qcAXSTSi91AW4l2c2p3BPF4yhog_3h4iocsB5g2J6Ia2eeWs4pOpbQYyBzPlVB3QmJJoCT5pZsV1aihozx5ttfKqw==)\n[3] [mrblue.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFhw0vN5nbk1rBdbFeKOF9a_v5dHnpGbUThyuORFbWRKr1dzvmjElT7xhEcxPDfvP3Dfn7XEGh9U9aKdXgCZBEWT78ZoQhzuKBFHL63JIxBeTsyLUO04lqJHysGdWnvtFNlv21WUNnAzxs=)\n[4] [naver.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE2ofLNxIWk0N-qYg29YYf3N_9DLyOY2EtN_o1JD9mPmMojFWbqHa2AP4QpCDp9qYML-qcAXSTSi91AW4l2c2p3BPF4yhog_3h4iocsB5g2J6Ia2eeWs4pOpbQYyBzPlVB3QmJJoCT5pZsV1aihozx5ttfKqw==)\n[5] [ridibooks.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEYfjaiI0hG8dj5p7N7MsJ34QUxiUiGbJYJFo4jG0K6jmwOcCrw9hhrIfPraQR5aKRa_XdwbFLWu_1LfY8GZVs6xOzbCeV1fTvlZ3oYO-V7_BWLw-GiV-MhShErKA==)\n[6] [yes24.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHv3tBG-OGBsEtCq51vzWOEENDl7srY_Yxp4JYosAkBBgWVaQoHCC6kLzXyz8A6-GyN-tWKt3LaRFKKFtLQIfAQgV38OxUkqpgYTJp5wTrhAQopDjGL87eEr6oE3PeBWyR_)\n[7] [arte.or.kr](https://ve